Depends: libc6, libnss3, libnspr4, libatk1.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0, libatspi2.0-0, libcups2, libdrm2, libudev1, libxkbcommon0, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxfixes3, libxrandr2, libgbm1, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libasound2 (>= 1.0.17), libglib2.0-0, libdbus-1-3, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxext6, libexpat1, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-4-1
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://magnetitebrowser.org
Description: Web browser with sidebar tabs and spaces
 Magnetite is a fast, open-source browser built around a sidebar: spaces,
 pinned tabs, a command bar, split view and tabs that archive themselves. It
 runs on the Chromium engine. No telemetry, no account.
 .
 This package adds Magnetite's package repository, so system updates keep it
 current.
